 :consensus-impact-note "Closes all 7 Blind Round-1 Digital Twin blockers: (1) removes devnet.bitecho.org <-> bitecho.org replay alias and enables :strict-network-uri? true + :network-genesis-cid binding on all networks; (2) separates :pointer/expires-epoch from now-ms, enforces fail-closed :path-acl + :directory-entity proofs (forbidding :self on dir/*), multi-segment /directory/v1/<net>/<path...> routing, canonical 88-char SPKI DER pubkeys, and browser allowed-persistence-keys; (3) adds dedicated [:vaults vault-id] SCI persistent vaults with monotonic :vault-seq, anti-malleability spend digest, 0-take :allocate restriction, :vault-spend-dac atomic revocation, and full 7-bucket 42B INV-C1 conservation; (4) wires in-band :rotate-validator-set & :cold-root-recovery receipts into Streamlet and checkpoint digest with epoch-indexed :validator-set-history catchup; (5) hardens hardware YubiKey faucet fail-closed (never trusting client authenticator_verified) with hardware uniqueness nullifiers and unlinkable blinded vouchers; (6) implements sovereign <net>/id/<pubkey-cid> roots, sociocratic double-linked consent with :purpose-cid (Simon's ratified amendment), 2027-06-30 human-anchor sunset, dissolve-circle, timelocked recovery, grow-only :advisory-twin-pubkeys, and :shared-encrypted privacy; (7) integrates deterministic CRN Monte Carlo harness + §8 fractal isolation foundations."
